Exception: src/nodeguard_kern.c is licensed GPL-2.0, not MIT. It is an eBPF/XDP
program that calls GPL-only kernel helpers and must declare a GPL license
(SEC("license") = "GPL") for the kernel to load it. Its SPDX header states this.
The compiled object (nodeguard_kern.o) inherits GPL-2.0. Everything else in this
repository (the userspace tooling, scripts, generators, and documentation) is
MIT as above.
